ME: ${me}
HAGRID'S HIDDEN POSITION: opening: ${clean(brief.opening_position, 300)} | ceiling: ${clean(brief.ceiling, 300)} | pressures: ${list(brief.pressures)} | could trade: ${list(brief.trades)} | moved by: ${clean(brief.what_moves_him, 300)}
